<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australia All Industrials index still in bear channel.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australia All Industrials index still in bear channel.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------All Industrials---------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 3725 3735 3760 *RSI-14 43.34 *MA-10 3713.6</p>
<p>3685 - 3735  *Sup 3700 3685 3655 *MA-20 3736.0 *MA-40 3793.4</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - April 15-----------</p>
<p>*All Industrials has retraced within bear channel</p>
<p>*Many indicators for index currently stalling</p>
<p>*Technical indicators for index mixed across all time frames</p>
<p>*All Industrials closed at 3,717.3 on Monday</p>
<p>The Australian All Industrials index has held well above support at 3,656 and has reached both its higher and lower retracement targets.</p>
</text>
